# The Elden Ring start screen: tabs, the inventory grid and the Sites of Grace
Output images/demo/hud.gif
Source docs/tapes/settings.tape
Hide
Type `cd "$DEMO_REPO" && clear && nvim --cmd "luafile $DEMO_LUA"`
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show
Sleep 1500ms
Type "l"
Sleep 700ms
Type "j"
Sleep 700ms
Type "l"
Sleep 1s
Tab
Sleep 1200ms
Tab
Sleep 1200ms
Type "K"
Sleep 2500ms
